    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49193" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρόμβ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρέφω, τέτροφα</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lump</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.179
			</span></i>; <i>clot</i> of blood, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				533
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Criti.</u>
				120a
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χολῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					2.75
				</span></i>
			; of milk, <i>curd</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰγῶν
				ἀπόρρους θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				52.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρόμβοι ἁλῶν</span>
			<i>coarse</i> salt, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>drop</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρόμβοι αἵματος καταβαίνοντες . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
					22.44
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>nipple,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PLond.
				1821.42
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ.: ὑψηλὸς τόπος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
